    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"Bioconductor-Physalia Courses\"\nexecute:\n  message: false\n  warning: false\n---\n\n![](/images/collaborations/Physalia-Logo-1000x358.png){width=\"35%\" fig-alt=\"Physalia Courses logo\"}\n\nBioconductor has partnered with [Physalia Courses](https://www.physalia-courses.org/) to offer co-branded training in bioinformatics and computational biology. These courses are taught by experienced instructors from the Bioconductor community and hosted by Physalia. Only the courses listed below are part of the Bioconductor–Physalia collaboration and eligible for free seats.\n\n## Upcoming Courses\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"reactable html-widget html-fill-item\" id=\"htmlwidget-b3986e5b33f4803f2905\" style=\"width:auto;height:auto;\"></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-b3986e5b33f4803f2905\">{\"x\":{\"tag\":{\"name\":\"Reactable\",\"attribs\":{\"data\":{\"date\":[\"3-14 November 2025\",\"17-21 November 2025\",\"17-19 November 2025\",\"TBD (May/June 2026)\",\"TBD\",\"2-6 February 2026\"],\"title\":[\"RNA-seq data analysis with R/Bioconductor\",\"Single-cell RNA-seq analysis with R/Bioconductor\",\"R/Bioconductor for Mass Spectrometry and Proteomics\",\"Network Analysis in Systems Biology with R/Bioconductor\",\"Single-cell proteomics with R and Bioconductor\",\"Orchestrating Microbiome Analysis with Bioconductor\"],\"instructors\":[\"Dr. Ludwig Geistlinger\",\"Fabricio Almeida-Silva, Dr. Jacques Serizay, and Dr. Orr Ashenberg\",\"Prof. Laurent Gatto\",\"Fabricio Almeida-Silva\",\"Prof. Laurent Gatto\",\"Prof. Leo Lahti and Dr. Tuomas Borman\"],\"link_html\":[\"<a href=\\\"https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/course19/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">View Course<\\/a>\",\"<a href=\\\"https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/course18/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">View Course<\\/a>\",\"<a href=\\\"https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/course58/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">View Course<\\/a>\",\"<a href=\\\"https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/network-in-systems-biology/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">View Previous Edition<\\/a>\",\"New Course\",\"<a href=\\\"https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/microbiomebioconductor/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">View Course<\\/a>\"]},\"columns\":[{\"id\":\"date\",\"name\":\"date\",\"type\":\"character\"},{\"id\":\"title\",\"name\":\"title\",\"type\":\"character\"},{\"id\":\"instructors\",\"name\":\"instructors\",\"type\":\"character\"},{\"id\":\"link_html\",\"name\":\"Workshop Link\",\"type\":\"character\",\"html\":true}],\"bordered\":true,\"striped\":true,\"compact\":true,\"dataKey\":\"f00e73901d71637414cb91481b447754\"},\"children\":[]},\"class\":\"reactR_markup\"},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n## Free Seats for Underrepresented Countries\n\nTwo free seats are available for each of the Bioconductor–Physalia courses listed above for participants based in low- or middle-income countries, as defined by the [World Bank's income classification](https://datatopics.worldbank.org/world-development-indicators/the-world-by-income-and-region.html).\n\n[Apply here to be considered](https://forms.gle/w4UEBu3VrJXemtTN9)\n\n## Learn More\n\nRead the [blog post](https://blog.bioconductor.org/posts/2025-06-20-physalia-collaboration/) announcing the collaboration to learn more about how it came together and what it aims to achieve.\n",
